---
// A single automation from the OPBC system, up close (2026-07-03, from the n8n deep-extract
// mining — Diagram B). The self-serve subscription flow: the most universally relatable piece
// ("let people manage their own list so you never touch a spreadsheet"). Generalized + show-safe.
// Compact horizontal flow (wraps on mobile). Pure CSS, no JS.
const steps = [
  { icon: '📝', label: 'Someone submits the form', biz: 'your inbound interest', desc: 'Name, email, and what they want to hear about — a public form, no login.' },
  { icon: '🔀', label: 'Matched or created', biz: 'no manual list edits', desc: 'The system finds their record by token or makes a new one. Nobody edits a list by hand.' },
  { icon: '🔑', label: 'Saved & secured', biz: 'your data updates itself', desc: 'The record is written and issued a private access token — the source of truth stays current on its own.' },
  { icon: '✉️', label: 'The right email goes out', biz: 'your people stay in control', desc: 'A welcome for new folks, or a passwordless magic-link to manage their own preferences.' },
];
---

<div class="micro">
  <div class="micro-intro">
    <strong>One workflow, up close.</strong> That system is ~12 automated workflows chained together. Here’s a single, very ordinary one — how people subscribe and manage themselves — so you can see the shape at the level you’d actually hire for.
  </div>
  <ol class="micro-flow" role="list">
    {steps.map((s, i) => (
      <li class="micro-node">
        <div class="micro-icon" aria-hidden="true">{s.icon}</div>
        <div class="micro-label">{s.label}</div>
        <div class="micro-biz">{s.biz}</div>
        <div class="micro-desc">{s.desc}</div>
        {i < steps.length - 1 && <div class="micro-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <div class="micro-caption">Nobody maintains a mailing list by hand — the audience manages itself. That’s one of a dozen such workflows behind the system above.</div>
</div>

<style>
  .micro { margin: var(--space-10) 0 var(--space-4); }
  .micro-intro { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 60ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-6); }
  .micro-intro strong { color: var(--color-text); }
  .micro-flow { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); align-items: stretch; }
  .micro-node { position: relative; flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg, var(--radius-md)); padding: var(--space-4); }
  .micro-icon { font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .micro-label { font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text); line-height: 1.3; }
  .micro-biz { font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-primary); margin-top: 2px; }
  .micro-desc { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.55; margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .micro-arrow { position: absolute; right: calc(-1 * var(--space-3) - 3px); top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--color-text-faint); font-size: var(--text-base); z-index: 1; }
  .micro-caption { font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-text-faint); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: var(--space-5); padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .micro-flow { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5); }
    .micro-arrow { right: auto; left: var(--space-4); top: auto; bottom: calc(-1 * var(--space-5) + 2px); transform: rotate(90deg); }
  }
</style>
